sequenceDiagram
    actor Maker
    actor Checker
    actor Publisher
    participant Boundary as Label workflow boundary
    participant Control as Snapshot/review control
    participant Validation as Real validator
    participant Store as Transactional records
    Maker->>Boundary: Create replacement with explicit declarations and task ID
    Boundary->>Control: Authorize maker and validate input
    Control->>Store: Lock product, require first unbound task
    Control->>Store: Insert snapshot/declarations and bind target
    Store-->>Maker: Fresh exact label binding
    Maker->>Validation: Validate exact label and rule set
    Validation->>Store: Record actual rule results
    alt Latest exact validation passes
        Maker->>Boundary: Submit exact label
        Boundary->>Control: Require permission, current bindings and validation
        Control->>Store: Label pending, task in review, submit audit
        Checker->>Boundary: APPROVE exact label
        Boundary->>Control: Require permitted independent checker
        Control->>Store: Approved label, approval/task/audit
        Publisher->>Boundary: Publish exact task and target
        Boundary->>Control: Require approved target/record and current guards
        Control->>Store: Atomic old/new publication, pointer, task and evidence
        Store-->>Publisher: Durable published state
    else Missing or failed validation
        Maker->>Boundary: Attempt submission
        Boundary-->>Maker: Conflict with zero review or publication writes
    end
